&ANALYZE-SUSPEND _UIB-CODE-BLOCK _PROCEDURE ver_ctacte B-table-Win 
PROCEDURE ver_ctacte :
/*------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Purpose:     ver como se abono el contrato
  Parameters:  <none>
  Notes:       
------------------------------------------------------------------------------*/
/*DEFINE INPUT PARAMETER rid AS ROWID.
